           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Choose a logo that looks good branded on hats, trailers and signs.</li><li>A Western or rustic style can suit rural customers, but keep it readable.</li><li>Make a square version for your Facebook page, often a small-town business's main website.</li><li>Ask for a one-color version for stamps and trailer decals.</li></ul>",
